+	Beacon and Data of spectific antenna path.
+	Note: This command is available only when STA is connected.
+              Driver will enable signalext and collect signal information for one second
+
+	where value of m is:
+		1   -- PATH A
+		2   -- PATH B
+		3   -- PATH A+B
