+	Examples:
+	mlanutl mlan0 getsignalext          :Get All path's signal.
+	mlanutl maln0 getsignalext 3        :Get path A+B signal
+	mlanutl maln0 getsignalext 1        :Get path A signal
+	mlanutl mlan0 getsignalext 2        :Get path B signal
