+per_pkt_cfg
+--------------
+    mlanutl <interface> per_pkt_cfg [tx_rx_control] [type_num] [ether_type1 ether_type2...] [tx_rx_control] [type_num] [ether_type1 ether_type2 ...]
+    This command is used to set tx/rx per packet Txctl and Rxinfo configuration.
